= Second National Congress of the Zhongguo Guomindang

The Second National Congress has been held in Canton, two years after the first one.

Today, nothing special happened except the election of Chiang Kai-shek to the Central Executive Committee.

Now that Chiang Kai-shek has reached the highest body in the party, his influence grows even larger.

The counter to Wang Jingwei might just win the power struggle entirely.
